{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……好」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4744", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在很早之前我就下定了决心。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和新吾交往一个月之后。", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "若是那时的自己在作为新吾女朋友这件事情上，\\n变得拥有自信的话。", "text_idx": 200, "plain": "若是那时的自己在作为新吾女朋友这件事情上，变得拥有自信的话。", "plain_idx": 201, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就要和美羽学姐坦白。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其实我在最初就明白了。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这只是自己的一厢情愿。", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为不论什么时候和美羽学姐坦白，她都会祝福我们。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我也明白了另一件事。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那就是学姐也被新吾所吸引了。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和美羽学姐一起去买他的钥匙扣，\\n深夜和学姐在活动室两人独处的时候。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": "和美羽学姐一起去买他的钥匙扣，深夜和学姐在活动室两人独处的时候。", "plain_idx": 209, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐总是挂念着新吾。", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明至今为止从未谈及过男性的话题。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但我们的话题总是围绕着新吾。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4745", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和新吾，还有学姐一样的钥匙扣。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是我的宝物。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我第一次喜欢上的男人。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "以及我一直尊敬着的学姐。\\n让同为女生的我也感到憧憬的女性。", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "以及我一直尊敬着的学姐。让同为女生的我也感到憧憬的女性。", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他们明明都是我非常重要的人。", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……但我却不想让新吾再接近学姐了。", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即便是现在我也很害怕。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果美羽学姐真的喜欢上了新吾，\\n那我将毫无胜算。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "如果美羽学姐真的喜欢上了新吾，那我将毫无胜算。", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为在女性方面我没有一个地方能与学姐匹敌……", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐，辛苦了」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4746", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，纱纱辛苦了」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3354", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我唯独有一样，没有输给学姐的东西。", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天，我向新吾展示了自己最原本的样子。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在他的怀中，大哭了一场。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，最后我们又一起庆祝了交往纪念日。", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他还说我做的菜很好吃。", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……我也因此变得自信了。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "唯独这个，我不会输给学姐——", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "唯独这个，我不会输给学姐——", "plain_idx": 238, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，我有件重要的事情要和学姐说」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4747", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「重要的事？」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3355", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。之前就一直打算和学姐说了……\\n　但是一直无法说出口……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「是的。之前就一直打算和学姐说了……　但是一直无法说出口……」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4748", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我笔直地注视着美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是什么啊？」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3356", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐露出了和平时一样的笑脸。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我紧紧地握住了手中的钥匙扣。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个，我……」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4749", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3357", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾曾提议和我一起来。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我说我要一个人来。", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我想靠着自己的脚站在学姐面前，\\n靠自己的语言去传达。", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "因为我想靠着自己的脚站在学姐面前，靠自己的语言去传达。", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……其实我有喜欢的人了」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4750", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在，我正在和那个人交往」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4751", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3358", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐丝毫不感到吃惊，\\n而是用温柔的眼神看着我。", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "学姐丝毫不感到吃惊，而是用温柔的眼神看着我。", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……果然，我赢不了学姐啊。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论是外貌还是性格，都是我理想中的样子。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和我过世的母亲有着同样的微笑。", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我很能明白理央为什么会觉得很怀念。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，我拥有一个不输给这样的学姐的东西。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为有它，\\n我才能像这样笔直地注视着学姐。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "因为有它，我才能像这样笔直地注视着学姐。", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我正在和新吾交往」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4752", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这件事情，一直以来我都瞒着学姐。\\n　明明爱理她们都知道，唯独学姐……」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "「这件事情，一直以来我都瞒着学姐。　明明爱理她们都知道，唯独学姐……」", "plain_idx": 276, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4753", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……仅对我保密啊」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3359", "char_id": "みう"}]}
