{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——学姐，是怎么看待新吾的？", "text_idx": 281, "plain": "——学姐，是怎么看待新吾的？", "plain_idx": 281, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想知道这个问题的答案。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管很害怕，但还是想问问学姐。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3360", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐摸了摸我的头，\\n并轻轻地抱住了我。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": "学姐摸了摸我的头，并轻轻地抱住了我。", "plain_idx": 287, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「终于，肯对我说了」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3361", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「终于？」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4755", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3362", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家，现在可以进来了哦？」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3363", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎……」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4756", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在学姐的信号下，活动室的门打开了。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不好意思。\\n　我本来没打算偷听的……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「不好意思。　我本来没打算偷听的……」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6603", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「活动室前这么热闹，\\n　安洁还以为发生什么事了呢」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": "「活动室前这么热闹，　安洁还以为发生什么事了呢」", "plain_idx": 304, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3985", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「庆祝，一下？」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5383", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～♪」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_pn0633", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么，就由安洁我来\\n　为各位准备美味的红茶吧」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": "「那么，就由安洁我来　为各位准备美味的红茶吧」", "plain_idx": 314, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3986", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是，等等啊……这、究竟是怎么回事？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4757", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后，新吾也进入了活动室，\\n尴尬地挠了挠头。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": "最后，新吾也进入了活动室，尴尬地挠了挠头。", "plain_idx": 319, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐好像之前就知道我们俩的事情了」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "「美羽学姐好像之前就知道我们俩的事情了」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前就知道，哎？！\\n　学、学姐，这是真的吗？」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": "「之前就知道，哎？！　学、学姐，这是真的吗？」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4758", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿嘿，从去年就知道了」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3364", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、为什么装作不知道的样子……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4759", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "面对脑袋一片混乱的我，\\n美羽学姐还是如往常一样微笑着。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": "面对脑袋一片混乱的我，美羽学姐还是如往常一样微笑着。", "plain_idx": 329, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为这么重要的事情，\\n　我希望你能亲口对我说……」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": "「因为这么重要的事情，　我希望你能亲口对我说……」", "plain_idx": 331, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3365", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4760", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为，我们俩是什么关系呀？」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3366", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4761", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐……」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4762", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在明明是在大家面前，但我的泪水却止不住地流。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为明白再怎么擦泪水也会流下来，\\n所以我只能拼命地压制住呜咽声。", "text_idx": 341, "plain": "因为明白再怎么擦泪水也会流下来，所以我只能拼命地压制住呜咽声。", "plain_idx": 342, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能遇上一个出色的人真是太好了，纱纱」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3367", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样一来，大家就都能给你献上祝福啦」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3368", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……美羽学……美羽学姐……」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4763", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……可以不用再忍着了哦？」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3369", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家都在支持着你……对吧？」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3370", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦好啦，在这么难得的庆祝会上，怎么能让别人一直看你哭呢」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6604", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「来来来，新吾同学你也别太拘谨了，快到纱纱的身边去」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": "「来来来，新吾同学你也别太拘谨了，快到纱纱的身边去」", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ag3987", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今晚煮红豆饭」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sk5384", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……谢谢大家」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾站在我的身边，轻轻拍了拍我的头。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，什么都没说就握住了我的手。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也回握了新吾的手。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4764", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管泪水依然止不住，但我却能够以笑脸面对大家。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要能待在这个人身边，我就能保持笑容。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和新吾交往了一个月零一天。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在我们终于可以在真正意义上说出，我们在交往了。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "现在我们终于可以在真正意义上说出，我们在交往了。", "plain_idx": 368, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
